{"id":"n14385-2-5","stage":2,"title":"도대체 · 简直","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14385-2-5-1","ko":"아직도 열쇠를 못 찾았어?","zh":"还没找到钥匙吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아직도","meaning":"尚未，还，仍然","explanation":"아직：尚未，还，仍然；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"아직","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71254","senseId":"1","lemma":"아직","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"열쇠를","meaning":"钥匙","explanation":"열쇠：钥匙；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"열쇠","audio":"/audio/5bebbcbf30ba30c05971.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26888","senseId":"1","lemma":"열쇠","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"못","meaning":"不会做动词所指的动作。","explanation":"못：不会做动词所指的动作。","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"찾았어?","meaning":"寻，觅，访，寻找，查","explanation":"찾다：寻，觅，访，寻找，查；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"찾다","audio":"/audio/0aa19509314fd87953eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57320","senseId":"1","lemma":"찾다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"fc3d924ec6725c21","term":"아직","zh":"尚未，还，仍然","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3","entryId":"71254","definition":"表示某事或状态成为怎么样需要过一段时间， 或者某事或状态不结束继续不断。","pronunciation":["아직"]},{"id":"5bebbcbf30ba30c0","term":"열쇠","zh":"钥匙","audio":"/audio/5bebbcbf30ba30c05971.mp3","entryId":"26888","definition":"可以锁上或打开门锁的工具。","pronunciation":["열ː쐬","열ː쒜"]},{"id":"89058d16546c1107","term":"못","zh":"不会做动词所指的动作。","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"不会做动词所指的动作。","pronunciation":["몯ː"]},{"id":"0aa19509314fd879","term":"찾다","zh":"寻，觅，访，寻找，查","audio":"/audio/0aa19509314fd87953eb.mp3","entryId":"57320","definition":"为了得到某物或为了见某人而四处查找；或指得到此物或见此人。","pronunciation":["찯따"]}],"audio":"/audio/2eb32f55723515779159.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14385-2-5-2","ko":"응. 도대체 어디에 뒀는지 기억이 안 나.","zh":"嗯。完全想不起来把它放在哪儿了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"도대체","meaning":"简直，就是","explanation":"도대체：简直，就是","readings":[{"term":"도대체","audio":"/audio/5961e5da228541d4e036.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14385","senseId":"2","lemma":"도대체","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어디에","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뒀는지","meaning":"搁，放置，摆放","explanation":"두다：搁，放置，摆放；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"두다","audio":"/audio/531b2c3977c491e8379e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67470","senseId":"1","lemma":"두다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"기억이","meaning":"记着，记住","explanation":"기억：记着，记住；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"기억","audio":"/audio/603669bd762779d98169.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38812","senseId":"1","lemma":"기억","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나.","meaning":"想起，想到","explanation":"나다：想起，想到；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"21","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"5961e5da228541d4","term":"도대체","zh":"简直，就是","audio":"/audio/5961e5da228541d4e036.mp3","entryId":"14385","definition":"令人遗憾，一点都不。","pronunciation":["도대체"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"531b2c3977c491e8","term":"두다","zh":"搁，放置，摆放","audio":"/audio/531b2c3977c491e8379e.mp3","entryId":"67470","definition":"放在某处。","pronunciation":["두다"]},{"id":"603669bd762779d9","term":"기억","zh":"记着，记住","audio":"/audio/603669bd762779d98169.mp3","entryId":"38812","definition":"不忘记或重新想起以前的模样、事实、知识、经验等。","pronunciation":["기억"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"想起，想到","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"想法或记忆等浮现。","pronunciation":["나다"]}],"audio":"/audio/4befa99da5f3f1afaa66.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.947,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=14385","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"중급","day":63,"sequenceScore":1.4605,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["嗯。完全想不起来把它放在哪儿了。","还没找到钥匙吗？","听说你运动很厉害？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["还没找到钥匙吗？","听说你运动很厉害？","嗯。完全想不起来把它放在哪儿了。"],"answer":2}]}
